{"id":"b716be95fb","t":"The Heavenly Demon Wants a Quiet Life","c":"cv","n":110,"l":106,"s":["ml","mg","az"],"k":{"ml":"the-heavenly-demon-wants-a-quiet-life","mg":"the-heavenly-demon-wants-a-quiet-life","az":"the-heavenly-demon-wants-a-quiet-life"},"u":1795288568017,"desc":"من قبل الاستوديو الذي قدم لكم {The Return of the Crazy Demon و Absolute Dominion و Reborn as the Heavenly Demon} في حياتي المقبلة، أود السير بطريقٍ ملؤه التغيير لو سنحت لي الفرصة. الشيطان العلوي، حصل على دليل حاسم لتحسين الفن الشيطاني المعزز للروح في لحظة وفاته! لم يكن “الفن الشيطاني المعزز للروح” مجرد استهلاك أرواح الآخرين بل استهلك روحه كذلك، بعد فتح عينيه، كان بجسم نبيل ضعيف قد يموت في أي لحظة… للنجاة، ينبغي له العثور على طريقٍ يقوّي جسمه الضعيف ذاك في منزل ليلي، الشيطان العلوي تحول الآن لملك الليل، يبدأ رحلته الطموحة ساعيًا للنجاة.","type":"manhwa","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اكشن","تناسخ","فنون قتاليه","مغامرة"],"src":{"ml":"the-heavenly-demon-wants-a-quiet-life","mg":"the-heavenly-demon-wants-a-quiet-life","az":"the-heavenly-demon-wants-a-quiet-life"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"the-heavenly-demon-wants-a-quiet-life|/manga/the-heavenly-demon-wants-a-quiet-life/1/","mg":"the-heavenly-demon-wants-a-quiet-life|","az":"the-heavenly-demon-wants-a-quiet-life|/series/the-heavenly-demon-wants-a-quiet-life/chapter-1"},"2":{"ml":"the-heavenly-demon-wants-a-quiet-life|/manga/the-heavenly-demon-wants-a-quiet-life/2/","mg":"the-heavenly-demon-wants-a-quiet-life|"},"3":{"ml":"the-heavenly-demon-wants-a-quiet-life|/manga/the-heavenly-demon-wants-a-quiet-life/3/","mg":"the-heavenly-demon-wants-a-quiet-life|"},"4":{"ml":"the-heavenly-demon-wants-a-quiet-life|/manga/the-heavenly-demon-wants-a-quiet-life/4/","mg":"the-heavenly-demon-wants-a-quiet-life|"},"5":{"ml":"the-heavenly-demon-wants-a-quiet-life|/manga/the-heavenly-demon-wants-a-quiet-life/5/","mg":"the-heavenly-demon-wants-a-quiet-life|"},"6":{"ml":"the-heavenly-demon-wants-a-quiet-life|/manga/the-heavenly-demon-wants-a-quiet-life/6/","mg":"the-heavenly